Darwin conf/Makefile.template "-I." position (config-generated headers).
Files directly in this directory are written by
10_tools/reconstruction/gen_config_headers.py from
06_reconstruction/config_options.tsv; do not edit them by hand
(check with gen_config_headers.py --check).
The subdirectory mach/ holds MIG output (memory_object_user.h,
memory_object_default.h) generated on the OPENSTEP 4.2 build host with
/usr/bin/mig -newipc from the real-machine SDK .defs files (run
08_build/runs/s5p61-mig-1, plan 87, 90); inputs, command and tool hashes
are in 07_kernel/PROVENANCE.tsv.  Do not edit them by hand.
